      "full_declaration": "AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Probability.BalancedRademacherCLT.balanced_count_sum_tendsto_gaussian",
      "file": "AutoSamplingTheory/TechnicalLemmas/Probability/BalancedRademacherCLT.lean",
      "signature_text": "theorem balanced_count_sum_tendsto_gaussian :\n    \u2203 laws : \u2115 \u2192 ProbabilityMeasure \u211d,\n      (\u2200 n : \u2115, (laws n : Measure \u211d) =\n        (((Fintype.card (Fin n \u2192 Bool) : \u211d\u22650\u221e)\u207b\u00b9 \u2022\n          (Measure.count : Measure (Fin n \u2192 Bool))).map\n          (fun \u03b5 : Fin n \u2192 Bool => (Real.sqrt (n : \u211d))\u207b\u00b9 *\n            \u2211 j : Fin n, if \u03b5 j then (1 : \u211d) else -1))) \u2227\n      (laws 0 : Measure \u211d) = Measure.dirac 0 \u2227\n      Tendsto (fun n : \u2115 => laws (n + 1)) atTop\n        (\ud835\udcdd (\u27e8gaussianReal 0 1, inferInstance\u27e9 : ProbabilityMeasure \u211d))\n",
      "signature_raw_sha256": "271595fa838cf28466cf90591d2c6aaa1024b42a1af73d85eee25cfc32e04777",
